-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that same middle went from 151% of normal in May to June down to 47% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, and grid 17874 bottomed out at 55% of normal that year.</p>"}
